{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124417","id":4834336186,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABICYdug","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124417","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124417.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124417.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124417","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124417/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124417/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124417/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bae13fc9e8964bbc501e85ce792474713607a358","number":124417,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Add \"Quick Fix\" to create function stub matching signal connection","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Implements part of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14307 (but does not close it completely)\r\n  - This PR could be expanded to also create general function stubs, and then perhaps close the issue.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n>[!note]\r\n> This PR is dependent on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121338 being merged first. It looks like the branch, and thus the PR itself, include #121338's commits in it so this _could_ technically be merged on its own and it would supersede #121338. But I think it would be better to merge #121338 on its own first, then have these changes reviewed and merged separately.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a \"Quick Fix\" code action, which detects when a non-existent function name is provided to a `Signal.connect()` call, and creates a function stub with the signal's signature below the current function.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/579e1a28-7b94-4c92-a7cd-fb55924d5550\r\n\r\n\r\n## To Do\r\n\r\n- [x] Confirm signal detection works when the signal belongs to the script class (i.e., defined with `signal some_name(...)` up above in the file)\r\n- [x] Confirm signal detection works when the signal is from the class the script inherits from (i.e., script has `extends SomeOtherClass`)\r\n- [x] Move detection/construction of code actions from `gdscript_analyzer.cpp` into `push_error()`, perhaps by adding a \"code action hint\" optional parameter to `push_error()`\r\n- [x] Ensure a code action that aims to insert text at the end of the file creates space for it\r\n- [x] Create tests\r\n- [x] Respect type hint settings for c